{"availability":"available","full":"emova-ollm/EMOVA","name":"EMOVA","description":"Official PyTorch implementation of EMOVA in CVPR 2025 (https://arxiv.org/abs/2409.18042)","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":81,"forks":6,"created":"2025-03-13T09:04:59Z","updated":"2025-03-16T03:19:54Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://emova-ollm.github.io/","topics":[],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Emova-ollm/EMOVA-demo","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:18.424Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:18.424Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:18.424Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T16:43:18.424Z","stars":81,"forks":6}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["🤗 EMOVA-Models | 🤗 EMOVA-Datasets | 🤗 EMOVA-Demo","📄 Paper | 🌐 Project-Page | 💻 Github | 💻 EMOVA-Speech-Tokenizer-Github","EMOVA (EMotionally Omni-present Voice Assistant) is a novel end-to-end omni-modal LLM that can see, hear and speak without relying on external models. Given the omni-modal (i.e., textual, visual and speech) inputs, EMOVA can generate both textual and speech responses with vivid emotional controls by utilizing the speech decoder together with a style controller. EMOVA possesses general omni-modal understanding and generation capabilities, featuring its superiority in advanced vision-language understanding, emotional spoken dialogue, and spoken dialogue with structural data understanding. We…"],"features":["State-of-the-art omni-modality performance: EMOVA achieves state-of-the-art comparable results on both vision-language and speech benchmarks simultaneously. Our best performing model, EMOVA-72B, even surpasses…","Emotional spoken dialogue: A semantic-acoustic disentangled speech tokenizer and a lightweight style control module are adopted for seamless omni-modal alignment and diverse speech style controllability. EMOVA supports…","Diverse configurations: We open-source 3 configurations, EMOVA-3B/7B/72B, to support omni-modal usage under different computational budgets. Check our Model Zoo and find the best fit model for your computational…","Fully open-source: we release all the materials when constructing EMOVA, including the pre-trained EMOVA checkpoints, the training/inference/evaluation code and the training/evaluation datasets!","Computational device: our codebase supports training/inference on both NVIDIA GPUs (e.g., A800 & H20) and Ascend NPUs (e.g., 910B3)!"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/emova-ollm/EMOVA/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"78f545aca881d5c7cfe7f4eae50778d2e7f317e6017defd747cad3e4e708aed6","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:18.522Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:18.522Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"🤗 EMOVA-Models | 🤗 EMOVA-Datasets | 🤗 EMOVA-Demo","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/emova-ollm/EMOVA/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"78f545aca881d5c7cfe7f4eae50778d2e7f317e6017defd747cad3e4e708aed6","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/emova-ollm/EMOVA/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:18.523Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-03-16T03:19:54Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/emova-ollm/EMOVA/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:18.524Z","hash":"78f545aca881d5c7cfe7f4eae50778d2e7f317e6017defd747cad3e4e708aed6","originalBytes":20837,"storedBytes":20837,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["emova","speech","model","example","training","configs","text","config","path","install","omni-modal","tokenizer","evaluation","format","inputs","bash","e.g.","launch","link","nativeanyres","npus","pip","port","qwen2","qwen2vit","code","npu","ascend","both","check","checkpoints","gradio","here","image","inference","note","origin","python","tokens","train","type","content","different","gpus","llm","necessary","outputs","role","support","a800","controller","data","demo","details.","dialogue","h20","import","master","node","